<title>USA: Leasing Solutions sets shr buyback.</title>
<headline>Leasing Solutions sets shr buyback.</headline>
<dateline>SAN JOSE, Calif. 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leasing Solutions Inc Wednesday said its board of directors authorized a stock repurchase program for up to one million shares of common stock.</p>
<p>In a statement, the company said the repurchase represents about 12 percent of the outstanding common shares.</p>
